      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} As of 9:30pm MST yesterday, with 5 others crashed within 30 minutes, cannot verify VRC BN, windows update 23H2 (disregard previous update 23 hours ago) and occurs with and without VR. Taking PC in to be evaluated, with probability of full PC factory reset.",
