  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. open vrc into private world.\n\n(50/50 chance disconnecting here)\n\n2. invite 3+ friends and show avatars\n\n3. 5+ minutes later, everyone freezes. \n\n4. ~15 seconds after freeze, encounter error in figure 1. relog and try again.\n\n4.a. during freeze, other players see victim as frozen.\n\nsee error log for details, notable error string: SCS v0 UDP SocketErrorCode: 0 WinSock\n\nnote: index pc, caches cleared, updated drivers, and occurred over multiple days. Possible conflicting applications removed",
